docs {
  # Submit TACOTS Onboarding
  
  Creates a new onboarding record for a TACOTS beneficiary who has been shortlisted from the recommendation stage. The form captures mental-health screening, physical-health information, enrolled school details, commitment declarations, and optional file uploads (parent signature and admission letter).
  
  On success, the onboarding record is saved to the database. The endpoint returns the newly created TACOTS onboarding object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  ### Core
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                  |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------|
  | studentId       | string | Yes      | UUID of the recommended student record        |
  | onboardingDate  | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format         |
  
  ### Mental Health Screening
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                                                                       |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | hasMentalHealthDiagnosis | string | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`, `NOT SURE`                                                                                                                                                                     |
  | diagnosedConditions      | array  | No       | Array of: `ADHD`, `AUTISM SPECTRUM`, `LEARNING DIFFICULTY`, `INTELLECTUAL DISABILITY`, `EMOTIONAL / BEHAVIORAL DISORDER`, `SPEECH OR LANGUAGE DELAY`, `ANXIETY OR DEPRESSION`, `NONE DIAGNOSED`, `OTHER` |
  | behavioralIndicators     | array  | Yes      | Array of: `DIFFICULTY CONCENTRATING`, `EASILY DISTRACTED`, `RESTLESS / HYPERACTIVE`, `DIFFICULTY UNDERSTANDING LESSONS`, `DIFFICULTY READING OR WRITING`, `DIFFICULTY FOLLOWING INSTRUCTIONS`, `FREQUENT EMOTIONAL OUTBURSTS`, `SOCIAL WITHDRAWAL`, `AGGRESSIVE BEHAVIOR`, `NONE OF THE ABOVE`, `OTHER` |
  | focusAbilityRating       | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                                                                                             |
  | emotionalStabilityRating | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                                                                                             |
  | peerInteractionRating    | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                                                                                             |
  | receivedCounseling       | string | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`, `NOT SURE`                                                                                                                                                                     |
  | needsSpecialSupport      | string | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`, `POSSIBLY / NEEDS ASSESSMENT`                                                                                                                                                 |
  | mentalHealthNotes        | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                                                                                                  |
  
  ### Physical Health
  
  | Field                  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                                   |
  |------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | generalHealthStatus    | string | Yes      | One of: `EXCELLENT`, `GOOD`, `FAIR`, `POOR`                                                                                                                    |
  | immunizationStatus     | string | Yes      | One of: `FULLY IMMUNIZED`, `PARTIALLY IMMUNIZED`, `NOT IMMUNIZED`, `STATUS UNKNOWN`                                                                           |
  | hasChronicCondition    | string | Yes      | One of: `NO`, `YES`, `NOT SURE`                                                                                                                                |
  | chronicConditions      | array  | No       | Array of: `ASTHMA`, `DIABETES`, `EPILEPSY`, `SICKLE CELL DISEASE`, `HEART CONDITION`, `PHYSICAL DISABILITY`, `VISION IMPAIRMENT`, `HEARING IMPAIRMENT`, `OTHER` |
  | allergies              | array  | Yes      | Array of: `NO KNOWN ALLERGIES`, `FOOD ALLERGIES`, `DRUG ALLERGIES`, `ENVIRONMENTAL ALLERGIES`, `OTHER`                                                        |
  | requiresMedication     | string | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`                                                                                                                                            |
  | physicalActivityLevel  | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                                                        |
  | physicalLimitations    | string | Yes      | One of: `NONE`, `DIFFICULTY WALKING OR RUNNING`, `DIFFICULTY SEEING`, `DIFFICULTY HEARING`, `OTHER`                                                           |
  | additionalHealthNotes  | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                                                             |
  
  ### Enrolled School Details
  
  | Field              | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                |
  |--------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | enrolledSchoolName | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                              |
  | enrolledSchoolTown | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                              |
  | enrolledSchoolLga  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                              |
  | enrolledSchoolState| string | Yes      | Valid Nigerian state (e.g. `ABIA`, `LAGOS`, `FCT`)                                          |
  | enrolledClass      | string | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY 3`–`PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1`–`JSS3`, `SS1`–`SS3`                                |
  | termResumptionDate | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                                       |
  | schoolFeesPerTerm  | number | No       | Optional numeric value                                                                      |
  
  ### Commitment & Programme Assignment
  
  | Field                     | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                      |
  |---------------------------|---------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentCommitment         | boolean | No       | Defaults to `false`                                                               |
  | parentGuardianCommitment  | boolean | Yes      | Defaults to `false`                                                               |
  | programOfficerNotes       | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                |
  | supportTypesApproved      | array   | No       | Array of: `TUITION (SCHOOL FEES)`, `SCHOOL RESOURCES`, `TRANSPORTATION`, `OTHER`  |
  | mentorName                | string  | No       | Optional text                                                                     |
  | sponsorName               | string  | No       | Optional text                                                                     |
  | additionalInfo            | string  | No       | Optional free text                                                                |
  
  ## File Uploads
  
  | Field            | MIME Types Accepted         | Required | Notes                                                                                         |
  |------------------|-----------------------------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | parentSignature  | `image/*` (JPEG, PNG, etc.) | No       | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/TACOTS-ASSETS/SIGNATURES` on Cloudinary                    |
  | admissionLetter  | PDF, image                  | No       | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/TACOTS-ASSETS/ADMISSION-LETTERS` on Cloudinary             |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created TACOTS onboarding record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                              |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `create` permission.                               |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Cloudinary upload failed or unexpected server error.                  |
}
